    "description": "Simply1 is the lower-sugar version of Arbonne's FeelFit shake. Per the label at the time of writing, two scoops (about 31 g) give 20 g of vegan protein for roughly 130 calories, with under 1 g of sugar and stevia as the only sweetener. It comes in vanilla, chocolate and strawberry. Arbonne sells it through its own Amazon storefront (sold by Arbonne International, LLC) at $101 for 30 servings, which works out to about $4.21 per 25 g of protein at the Amazon price we saw.",
