          </p>

          <p>
            The other cost to watch is the membership and autoship structure. Arbonne has offered a Preferred Client membership for an annual fee that unlocks member pricing and shipping perks, and consultants often encourage monthly autoship. That can make sense if you drink one shake a day and would buy it anyway. Cancel it if you find yourself with unopened bags in the cupboard.
